title: "Attributing Test-Time Token-Cap Gains in Mathematical Reasoning: Continuation Versus Resampling"
abstract: >-
  A request-seeded three-arm protocol that separates trajectory replacement
  from the effect of adding tokens to a shared prefix, together with the
  inference and analysis pipeline, fixed dataset snapshots, summary result
  tables, and reproducibility manifests that back the accompanying manuscript.
